<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs $0.25 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs $0.25 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.25</p>
<p>lower. Trading slow.</p>
<p>Top $56.75 per cwt. - USDAUS 1-3    220-260 lbs   55.75-56.225</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs   55.25-56.75</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs   54.25-55.25</p>
<p>Sows 300-450 lbs, 0.50-0.75 higher, 450-500 lbs steady, 500-650</p>
<p>lbs 0.50-2.00 higher. Top 50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-450 lbs    45.00-45.25</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    47.00</p>
<p>	    500-650 lbs    48.00-50.00</p>
</text>
